# Upload rules for `railway up`.
#
# This file exists because `dist/` is in .gitignore and `railway up` falls back
# to .gitignore when deciding what to upload, so the build context arrived
# without dist/ and the old `COPY dist/ dist/` failed with `"/dist": not found`.
#
# The Dockerfile now compiles TypeScript itself, so src/, tsconfig.json and
# scripts/ must reach the build context. dist/ does not — the image builds its
# own, which means a stale local dist/ can no longer be deployed by accident.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.github

# Secrets — never in a build context.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.p8

# Not needed to build the image — excluded to keep the upload small.
tests
benchmark
docs
ops
marketing
site
journal
examples
integrations
dashboard
compliance
claude-plugin
.claude
.husky
.smithery
*.log
*.md
